      ],
      "text": "The compose templates set shm_size 2g because Chromium heavily uses /dev/shm and Docker's 64MB default causes tab crashes, and grant SYS_ADMIN, SYS_PTRACE, and seccomp=unconfined as the retained browser profile, with hardening described as a separate change."
