      ],
      "text": "Environment variables are documented as all optional, covering timezone (TZ), UID/GID remapping (PUID/PGID), Node heap size, SMB polling flags, Apprise notification URLs (Discord, Telegram, Slack, email, etc.), and AI provider API keys."
    },
