      "text": "OpenAI API keys cannot authenticate Claude Code; they work with the bundled Codex CLI instead, and ChatGPT Plus/Pro subscribers authenticate Codex via codex login --device-auth, optionally exposing port 1455 for the browser callback flow."
    },
