  "summary": "Selected evidence records: The container runs the official Anthropic Claude Code CLI (not a wrapper or proxy), served through a CloudCLI web UI on port 3001, with s6-overlay as PID 1 supervising Xvfb on :99 and optional sshd. The image bundles Chromium with Xvfb and Playwright for headless browser screenshots and testing, plus database clients (psql, redis-cli, sqlite3, MariaDB-based mysql) and GitHub CLI.",
  "superseded_claim_ids": []
}
